msgstr "{pending, plural, one {# zmena sa synchronizuje, keď budete znova online} few {# zmeny sa synchronizujú, keď budete znova online} many {# zmeny sa synchronizuje, keď budete znova online} other {# zmien sa synchronizuje, keď budete znova online}}"

#. Under the email field on the sign-in screen: a new code was asked for too soon after the last one. # is how many seconds are left, and can be 0.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
