#. VoiceOver only: the bell button's value, how many notifications are unread. # is that number.
#: src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx
msgid "{unreadCount, plural, other {# unread}}"
msgstr "{unreadCount, plural, one {# neprečítané} few {# neprečítané} many {# neprečítaného} other {# neprečítaných}}"

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: removing or demoting this owner would leave the list with none. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "a list must keep at least one owner"
